{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Sky Fields: Goober Gardens</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch into the Sky Fields universe with Goober Gardens, the foundational tale that sets the stage for countless adventures<i>.</i>\u00a0Nurture your Goobers, grow a lush garden, and shape your own floating paradise in this relaxing voxel pet-sim adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.poster.avif?t=1759945047\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.webm?t=1759945047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and care for your Goobers\u2014feed them exotic fruits, keep them happy, and help them grow into strong adults. Breed them to pass down stats, abilities, and unique looks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/0c9c4d1abb18e857140b31eb740c937f.avif?t=1759945047\" data-has-big width=800 height=295 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow a Garden</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, grow, and nurture your dream garden! Collect seeds and pots to cultivate vibrant plants and towering trees. Experiment with mutated fruits and veggies to unlock powerful boosts and buffs for your Goobers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expedition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your trusty Mossbot loose into the wilds of Sky Fields to hunt for resources, rare Goobers, and hidden collectibles. Every expedition brings new treasures that give you a chance to grow your garden and expand your experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wandering merchant drifts through the skies\u2014trade your goods for shiny gold and grab exclusive Items and Goobers while they last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/7140e061b3f6894a74aa24ecbd216853.poster.avif?t=1759945047\" width=307 height=91 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/7140e061b3f6894a74aa24ecbd216853.webm?t=1759945047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your Garden thrives, mischievous Goober trainers bring their ravenous Goobers which will stop at nothing to snatch your precious harvest! Rally your hardy Goobers to fend off the invaders and protect your crops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/36a1d4b0fd3b8872a61e654ee8f8e31f.poster.avif?t=1759945047\" width=307 height=91 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/36a1d4b0fd3b8872a61e654ee8f8e31f.webm?t=1759945047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675950?t=1759945047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/2e94d1c23f648c78de64437a7dbd33033d75f661/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759945047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/c7067ad9a5b5fed500d171d447e62a2ea93e62f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759945047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/c7067ad9a5b5fed500d171d447e62a2ea93e62f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759945047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3797170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Sky Fields: Goober Gardens</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch into the Sky Fields universe with Goober Gardens, the foundational tale that sets the stage for countless adventures<i>.</i>\u00a0Nurture your Goobers, grow a lush garden, and shape your own floating paradise in this relaxing voxel pet-sim adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.poster.avif?t=1759945047\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.webm?t=1759945047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and care for your Goobers\u2014feed them exotic fruits, keep them happy, and help them grow into strong adults. Breed them to pass down stats, abilities, and unique looks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/0c9c4d1abb18e857140b31eb740c937f.avif?t=1759945047\" data-has-big width=800 height=295 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow a Garden</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, grow, and nurture your dream garden! Collect seeds and pots to cultivate vibrant plants and towering trees. Experiment with mutated fruits and veggies to unlock powerful boosts and buffs for your Goobers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expedition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your trusty Mossbot loose into the wilds of Sky Fields to hunt for resources, rare Goobers, and hidden collectibles. Every expedition brings new treasures that give you a chance to grow your garden and expand your experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wandering merchant drifts through the skies\u2014trade your goods for shiny gold and grab exclusive Items and Goobers while they last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/7140e061b3f6894a74aa24ecbd216853.poster.avif?t=1759945047\" width=307 height=91 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/7140e061b3f6894a74aa24ecbd216853.webm?t=1759945047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your Garden thrives, mischievous Goober trainers bring their ravenous Goobers which will stop at nothing to snatch your precious harvest! Rally your hardy Goobers to fend off the invaders and protect your crops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/36a1d4b0fd3b8872a61e654ee8f8e31f.poster.avif?t=1759945047\" width=307 height=91 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/36a1d4b0fd3b8872a61e654ee8f8e31f.webm?t=1759945047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Lontis, The Developer"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/a7340a999ff8f8ef0085a87f51dbbda643effd5f/header.jpg?t=1759945047","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3675950/2054443896/df51cec55aaa8d06db8187a884ef4ff57c4c7c7a/1759944709/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759945046","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3675950/2054443896/df51cec55aaa8d06db8187a884ef4ff57c4c7c7a/1759944709/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759945046","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3675950/2054443896/df51cec55aaa8d06db8187a884ef4ff57c4c7c7a/1759944709/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759945046","id":257214394,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214394/movie480.mp4?t=1759945046","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214394/movie_max.mp4?t=1759945046"},"name":"Sky Fields: Goober Gardens Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214394/1158756688fd81ac52452094f1c901806b782e58/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759945046","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214394/movie480.webm?t=1759945046","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214394/movie_max.webm?t=1759945046"}}],"name":"Sky Fields: Goober Gardens","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<stro